# Phase discipline

Read [docs/master-spec.md](docs/master-spec.md) and the current phase doc before changing code.

Work only on the current phase. The current phase is Phase 6.

Do feature work on `develop`. Merge to `main` only when the user is ready for production.

Phase 6 may add fixed-price listings, admin approval, and marketplace display. Do not add auctions, payments, Stripe, quota reservation, or authority integrations. Never delete quota ledger rows.

Do not create later-phase tables or speculative architecture.

Keep dependencies minimal. Prefer the simplest solution that satisfies the current phase.

Stop at the end of each phase. After acceptance criteria pass, report results and wait for instruction.
